[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9121.19, "timestamp": "02:32:01", "text": "确实如此。 [笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9124.07, "timestamp": "02:32:04", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9128.87, "timestamp": "02:32:08", "text": "我的意思是，我可以做兼职，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9131.59, "timestamp": "02:32:11", "text": "是的，即使是兼职，签证也是个问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9142.95, "timestamp": "02:32:22", "text": "相反，他们有更稳定的方式。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9153.19, "timestamp": "02:32:33", "text": "我甚至不知道自己能不能胜任工作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9156.469, "timestamp": "02:32:36", "text": "你明白我的意思吗？我唯一擅长的就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9159.19, "timestamp": "02:32:39", "text": "比如流媒体、电脑之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9161.51, "timestamp": "02:32:41", "text": "技术方面的内容。就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9164.855, "timestamp": "02:32:44", "text": "实用的东西。我甚至不知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9166.82, "timestamp": "02:32:46", "text": "[笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9168.785, "timestamp": "02:32:48", "text": "[倒吸一口气]"}]